==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*6 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 100~106.67 seconds<sup>3,000f~3,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 180 seconds<sup>5,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Grand Emperor Warumongar]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Equip [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] before entering the stage, it's a surprise tool that will help you later. Get a Double Bounty kill from Gabriel and Devil Wife at the start (preferably with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]), then nuke Angelic Gory with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] once he spawns. Use the cash he drops to send in [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Prime DX]]. [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] alone is enough to hold the lines for the most part, but you can use other tanks like [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] too if available. You will need [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] to pick up the slack for Zory and Malizabeth, though.

Grand Emperor Warumongar's magnification is insanely high in this stage, so Giga-Nyan will only survive a few hits before going to a farm up north. However, in the time that it's alive, it'll accumulate a lot of damage on Warumongar and chunk Malizabeth quite a bit. Use [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]] to quickly drain the remainder of Malizabeth's HP. When Zory appears and burrows, Holy Blast him and wait until the next time Warumongar attacks, that way you can safely nuke him with Awakened Bahamut Cat. You need to be prepared for when he revives, so keep Giga-Nyan handy for when he does. Once you dispatch Zory, the remaining threats are nothing to worry about; Malizabeth, Devil Wife, and the Gabriels can all be easily handled by Red Nyanko Ranger and Can Can Cat without trouble.

